Subject: [PATCH] Document the theme's options, the video snapshot and the new
 bindings

- THEMES.md: the theme variables esRenderOnChange, esIdlePause and
  esBindShownOnly and the settings that override them ("auto" and -1 by
  default); a video's snapshot property; the parse's time limit and the
  retry after a timeout.
- THEMES_BINDINGS.md: hidden containers left unbound only when the theme
  asks, their videos bound all the same; {game:saveStatesSupported};
  {global:lastPlayed} leaves emulators out too.
---
